			<note type="warning" id="e04303">
				<ul id="e04304">
					<li>
						<p>If the trailer connector is not properly connected or the trailer menu is not configured correctly, the control stability of the driver assistance systems may be reduced, which could lead to an accident.</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>The trailer menu settings are retained even after the vehicle is restarted. Always check that the connector is properly connected and the settings are correct before driving carefully.</p>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</note>
